@startuml SD-03 Assign Node
title SD-03 Assign Node

actor Technician
participant "Node Registration Page" as Page
participant "Node API" as API
participant "Node Assigner Service" as Service
database "Database" as DB
participant "WebSocket Manager" as WS

Technician -> Page: Fill node assignment form
Page -> API: POST /nodes/{device_id}/assign
API -> Service: assign_node_record()
Service -> DB: Validate and save node assignment
DB --> Service: Saved node
Service --> API: Node data
API -> WS: Broadcast node_assigned
API --> Page: Assignment success
WS -> Page: Live node update
Page -> Technician: Show assigned node

@enduml